+// ---- Triple-monitor per-region camera cb override ----------------------------
+// Precomputed per-region matrices (column-major, m[col*4+row]) from compute_matrices.py.
+// Camera-INDEPENDENT: P_region = the region projection (Squeeze_i * off-axis frustum),
+// and its inverse. Applied at runtime as: projection_i = P_region,
+// inverseProj_i = inv(P_region), relativeViewProjection_i = P_region * relativeView.
+// This does NOT bake in the game's projection, so it works for any camera (garage,
+// cockpit, cinematic). Column-major (m[col*4+row]) from compute_matrices.py.
+// v1.13: las matrices de region ya NO se hornean aca. Se construyen en RUNTIME a
+// partir de (a) las constantes de geometria K que el d3dx.ini publica en IniParams
+// ([Present] las recalcula por frame desde $eye_d / $panel / $angulo) y (b) el near
+// REAL de la camara capturada. Hornearlas fue un bug: TRIPLE_PREG asumia near=0.052
+// pero la camara de conduccion real tiene near=0.1, y la correccion del shader
+// preserva el near del juego -> la inversa tenia que usar el mismo near o las
+// sombras quedan a profundidad equivocada.
+//
+// Layout de IniParams (ver [Present] en d3dx.ini):
+//   fila0 = (region, KA, KB, KC)   fila1 = (KXc, KYc, sen_ang, cos_ang)
+#define TRIPLE_KA   (G->iniParams[0].y)
+#define TRIPLE_KB   (G->iniParams[0].z)
+#define TRIPLE_KC   (G->iniParams[0].w)
+#define TRIPLE_KXC  (G->iniParams[1].x)
+#define TRIPLE_KYC  (G->iniParams[1].y)
+#define TRIPLE_SA   (G->iniParams[1].z)
+#define TRIPLE_CA   (G->iniParams[1].w)
